{
  "date": "2026-02-28",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭐해",
      "en": "What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘이 첫콘인데",
      "en": "Today is the first concert."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "응원봉 준비 헸지??",
      "en": "You prepared your lightstick, right??"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나도 열심히",
      "en": "I'm also working hard"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "준비중이애",
      "en": "getting ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 네일을",
      "en": "No, I got my nails"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "새로해서",
      "en": "done recently,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오타기 많이나네",
      "en": "so I keep making a lot of typos."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "타이페이",
      "en": "Taipei."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "8명에서 온적은 있지만",
      "en": "We've come here as 8 members before,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "24명ㅇ은 첨이니끼",
      "en": "but it's the first time coming as 24,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 새로워",
      "en": "so it feels really new."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "24인팬싸도 넘 웃겼음",
      "en": "The 24-member fansign was so funny too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제 이벤트들 뭔가 다 신기하거 재밌어서",
      "en": "All the events yesterday felt kind of fascinating and fun,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시간이 빨리간 느낌이야",
      "en": "so it felt like time passed really quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "24인팬싸는",
      "en": "For a 24-member fansign,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아티보다 팬분이 더 힘들것같은 스케줄",
      "en": "it honestly feels like the fans have a harder schedule than the artists."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "24명이랑 돌아가며 계속 다른얘기 해야하고",
      "en": "You have to keep talking to 24 different people in rotation,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "물 너무 먹고싶을듯",
      "en": "I'd probably want to drink so much water."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제 웨이브가 더 고생했다ㅏ",
      "en": "WAV had it even harder yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "항상 해외에",
      "en": "Whenever we come overseas,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오면",
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "신기하구 재밌는 이벤트",
      "en": "there are always lots of interesting and fun events,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "많아서",
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "재밌엉",
      "en": "so it's really fun."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러게 한국에사도",
      "en": "It'd be nice if we could do that in Korea too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "히면 좋겠넹",
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 맛있는거 많이먹고",
      "en": "I'll eat lots of delicious food"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "추천해줄게~",
      "en": "and recommend them to you~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어제먹는 우육면 진짜",
      "en": "The beef noodle soup I ate yesterday"
